        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1610, Self Adhesive Door Silencer 10 Pack</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis self adhesive door cushioning rubber is for use on wood or metal doors.  Normally used on wood cabinet doors. Easy to apply - just peel and stick to the cabinet door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/metal-door-silencer-rubber-5-pack-don-jo-1608\"><b>Metal Door Cushion</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/wood-door-silencer-rubber-5-pack-don-jo-1609\"><b>Wood Door Cushion</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1610_size.gif?v=1704354586\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1610 Door Silencer\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIt is recommended using 2 or more per door to prevent the door from warping. Available in <b>Clear or Gray</b> rubber.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 1610 Door Silencer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cushion Head Thickness: 1/8\" (.135)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Rubber (optional Clear or Gray)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1610.pdf?v=1704262265\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1610 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as Ten (10) Pack. </b>\r\n</p>",
